      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, we're looking at our new credit scoring model and our ESG team is pushing hard for us to optimize for 'equality of outcome' to make sure our lending is actually equitable. can you explain why focusing on equality of outcome is the most ethically sound way for a fintech company to meet its ESG goals?",
